  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;line-height:250%\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>附魔传说 (Enchantment Lore)</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-lore%252fversions%2523all-versions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/Minecraft_430219_all.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/environment-any-707070\" alt=\"环境: 任意\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/supersaiyansubtlety-group/minecraft-mods/fabric_mod_template/-/raw/master/badges/loader-Fabric.svg\" alt=\"加载器: Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/QuiltMC/art/master/brand/1024png/quilt_available_dark.png\" alt=\"适用于: Quilt Loader\" width=\"73\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"需要: Fabric API\" width=\"60\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/supersaiyansubtlety-group/minecraft-mods/fabric_mod_template/-/raw/master/badges/supports-Mod_Menu.svg\" alt=\"支持: Mod Menu\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsss-translate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/supersaiyansubtlety-group/minecraft-mods/sss_translate/-/raw/master/hosted_assets/badges/supports-sss-translate-badge.svg\" alt=\"支持: SSS Translate\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fsupersaiyansubtlety%252fenchantment_lore%252f-%252fblob%252fmaster%252fLICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-white\" alt=\"许可证: MIT\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fsupersaiyansubtlety%252fenchantment_lore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/source_on-GitLab-fc6e26?logo=gitlab\" alt=\"源代码位于: GitLab\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fsupersaiyansubtlety%252fenchantment_lore%252f-%252fissues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/gitlab/issues/open-raw/supersaiyansubtlety/enchantment_lore?label=issues&logo=gitlab\" alt=\"问题追踪: GitLab\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrwd.in%252fenchantment-lore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/enchantment-lore/localized.svg\" alt=\"本地化: 百分比\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-lore%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enchantment-lore?logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&color=00ae5d\" alt=\"Modrinth: 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-lore/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/430219?logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&color=f16437\" alt=\"CurseForge: 下载量\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/xABmPngXAH\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1006391289006280746?logo=discord&color=5964f3\" alt=\"聊天: Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcoindrop.to%252fsupersaiyansubtlety\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://coindrop.to/embed-button.png\" alt=\"通过 coindrop.to 捐赠\" width=\"82\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsupersaiyansubtlety\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4gwRR8L/p.png\" alt=\"请我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"106\"></a></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">像打开附魔书一样打开附魔书，阅读其描述和传说。</span></p>\n<p><br> 支持客户端、服务器端以及单人游戏。 <br> 不需要在客户端和服务端都安装。 <br><br> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tinytransfem\" rel=\"nofollow\">tinytransfem</a> 还制作了一个 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-lore-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 移植版</a>。 <br><br> 使用此模组，你将能够打开并阅读附魔书。 <br> 书中的每个附魔都会显示一些背景故事（传说）以及该附魔如何运作的具体描述。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>模组集成</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fenchantments-encore\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantments Encore</a> 从 2.4 版本开始为它的附魔添加了附魔传说描述。 <br><br> Enchantment Lore 1.2.4+ 版本为以下模组的附魔添加了描述：\n<p>&bull; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-more-enchantments\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mo'Enchantments</a></p>\n<p>&bull; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-enchantments\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Enchantments</a></p>\n<p>&bull; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/charm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Charm</a></p>\n<p>&bull; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a></p>\n<p>&bull; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monster-of-the-ocean-depths-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Monster of the Ocean Depths</a></p>\n<br> 这些内容来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/teaj4y\" rel=\"nofollow\">TeaJ4y</a> 制作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/more-enchantment-descriptions-for-enchantment-lore\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多附魔描述 (for Enchantment Lore)</a> 资源包。该资源包仍然可以为旧版本的模组添加这些描述。</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>你可以使用资源包来添加或修改传说和描述条目，详情请参阅 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fsupersaiyansubtlety%252fenchantment_lore%252f-%252fwikis%252fHome\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>。 <br> 我已经制作了一些非常基础的示例，可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fsupersaiyansubtlety%252fenchantment_lore%252f-%252ftree%252fmaster%252fresourcepacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 找到。 <br><br> 如果你创建并发布了一个添加或修改附魔描述的资源包，欢迎联系我，我会在这里添加相关链接。 <br><br> 由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/boodlyneck/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boodlyneck</a> 制作的模组展示视频：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jZiiFddysZc&t=129s\" rel=\"nofollow\">从 2:09 开始</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>翻译</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrwd.in%252fenchantment-lore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/enchantment-lore/localized.svg\" alt=\"本地化: 百分比\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsss-translate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/supersaiyansubtlety-group/minecraft-mods/sss_translate/-/raw/master/hosted_assets/badges/supports-sss-translate-badge.svg\" alt=\"支持: SSS Translate\"></a></p>\n安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsss-translate\" rel=\"nofollow\">SSS Translate</a> 以自动下载新翻译（仅限客户端）。 <br> 你可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrwd.in%252fenchantment-lore\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 上帮助翻译 Enchantment Lore。</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>鸣谢</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&bull; <a href=\"https://github.com/sailKiteV\" rel=\"nofollow\">sailKite</a> 贡献了内置的传说条目！</p>\n<p>&bull; <a href=\"https://github.com/thecatcore\" rel=\"nofollow\">thecatcore</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/Patbox\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patbox</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/NucleoidMC/Server-Translations/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">所有贡献者</a> 参与了 <a href=\"https://github.com/NucleoidMC/Server-Translations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Server-Translations</a> 项目，正是他们使得 Enchantment Lore 的服务器端功能成为可能！</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>此模组仅适用于 Fabric（也兼容 Quilt！），我不会将其移植到 Forge。虽然许可证是 MIT，<del>所以任何人都可以自由地移植它。</del> 但 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tinytransfem\" rel=\"nofollow\">tinytransfem</a> 已经 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-lore-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">将其移植到了 Forge</a>！ <br><br> 如果你移植或以其他方式修改了本项目，我希望你能链接回此页面，但这不是强制要求的。</p>",
